			"notes": "Beta. Fixes speech recognition on Windows: the Kazakh word grammar was being encoded with the system code page instead of UTF-8, so no spoken word could match. Also ends an utterance when the recognized text stops changing, so a noisy microphone cannot block results, and logs each recognized phrase to latest.log for diagnosing problems. Needs Fabric Loader, Fabric API and Java 21."
